     1453   FUNCTION get-shift RETURNS DATE
     1454     ( BUFFER buf_c-fin-doc FOR ub.c-fin-doc, OUTPUT p-shift-name-num AS CHARACTER )  FORWARD.
     1455   DEFINE MENU MENU-B-client
